 menüye aktarmamı ister misiniz? Do not answer the question.\"},\"task_message\":\"No tool call. Do not answer the out-of-scope question. Only ask: Size bu konuda yardımcı olamıyorum. Sizi ana menüye aktarmamı ister misiniz?\",\"loop_prompt\":\"No tool call. Ask briefly again: Sizi ana menüye aktarmamı ister misiniz?\",\"max_node_turns\":3,\"max_turn_transition\":\"end_fail\",\"extraction_schema\":[{\"name\":\"oos_reply\",\"type\":\"string\",\"enum_values\":[\"menu_yes\",\"continue\",\"unclear\"],\"description\":\"Always output a value. menu_yes: clearly wants to go to the main menu. continue: wants to continue with the current statement/card topic. unclear otherwise.\",\"min_confidence\":0.5}],\"excluded_nodes\":[\"g_oos\",\"end_menu\",\"end_xfer\",\"end_fail\",\"end_nocard\",\"end_rdg\",\"end_mail_no\",\"end_mail_ok\",\"end_week_ok\",\"end_third\",\"end_agent\",\"end_agent_q\",\"end_agent_pay\",\"end_agent_dis\",\"end_agent_svc\",\"end_agent_wk\",\"end_silent\"],\"transitions\":[{\"target_node\":\"end_xfer\",\"description\":\"Caller wants the main menu\",\"condition\":{\"logic\":\"or\",\"conditions\":[{\"variable\":\"oos_reply\",\"operator\":\"equals\",\"operand\":\"menu_yes\"}]}},{\"target_node\":\"__previous__\",\"description\":\"Caller wants to continue\",\"condition\":{\"logic\":\"or\",\"conditions\":[{\"variable\":\"oos_reply\",\"operator\":\"equals\",\"operand\":\"continue\"}]}}]}}},\"coverage\":[{\"requirement_id\":\"R01\",\"nodes\":[\"init\",\"fetch_cards\"],\"implementation\":\"No identity prompts; cards.list is the first call using customerNumber; no opening text.\"},{\"requirement_id\":\"R02\",\"nodes\":[\"read_debt\",\"offer\",\"g_oos\",\"g_pay\",\"g_dispute\"],\"implementation\":\"Debt, week and e-mail offered; payment/dispute to agent; rest out of scope.\"},{\"requirement_id\":\"R03\",\"nodes\":[\"fetch_cards\",\"prep_cards\",\"end_nocard\",\"end_agent_svc\"],\"implementation\":\"404 or zero isMainCard cards gives the no-eligible sentence and main me