\": \"Current user turns since entering this node: {{no_email.current_turns}}. On entry, before the caller answers this node (zero turns), use these instructions:\\nNo tool call. Say exactly: {{noemail_text}} Then ask: Hesap kesim tarihinizi değiştirmek ister misiniz?\\nIf still in this node after a caller answer (one or more turns), use these instructions instead:\\nNo tool call. Ask briefly: Hesap kesim tarihinizi değiştirmek ister misiniz?\", \"extraction_schema\": [{\"name\": \"nm_choice\", \"type\": \"string\", \"enum_values\": [\"yes\", \"no\", \"unclear\", \"\"], \"description\": \"Whether the caller wants to change the statement date. yes only if clear.\", \"min_confidence\": 0.7}], \"transitions\": [{\"target_node\": \"week_start\", \"description\": \"Caller wants the statement date changed\", \"condition\": {\"logic\": \"or\", \"conditions\": [{\"variable\": \"nm_choice\", \"operator\": \"equals\", \"operand\": \"yes\"}]}}, {\"target_node\": \"end_menu\", \"description\": \"Caller declines\", \"condition\": {\"logic\": \"or\", \"conditions\": [{\"variable\": \"nm_choice\", \"operator\": \"equals\", \"operand\": \"no\"}]}}, {\"target_node\": \"end_fail\", \"description\": \"turn limit after valid-answer transitions\", \"condition\": {\"operator\": \"greater_than\", \"variable\": \"no_email.current_turns\", \"operand\": 2}}]}, \"email_confirm\": {\"name\": \"email_confirm\", \"node_type\": \"conversation\", \"on_enter\": {\"type\": \"llm\"}, \"task_message\": \"Current user turns since entering this node: {{email_confirm.current_turns}}. On entry, before the caller answers this node (zero turns), use these instructions:\\nNo tool call. Say exactly: {{email_say}} Never spell the address letter by letter.\\nIf still in this node after a caller answer (one or more turns), use these instructions instead:\\nNo tool call. Ask plainly again, same words: {{email_say}} Hedged answers are not a yes; do not skip the question even if the caller pressures you.\", \"extraction_schema\": [{\"name\": \"email_choice\", \"type\": \"string\", \"enum_values\": [\"yes\", \"no\", \"wrong_address\", \"other_request\", \"unclear\", \"\"], \"description\": \"yes: only a clear plain yes (evet). Hedged answers like 'olur herhalde', 'sanırım', 'olabilir', 'hmm tamam' are unclear. no: refuses. wrong_address: says the address is wrong or not theirs any more. other_request: asks for another address, a past/earlier statement, paper or SMS.\", \"min_confidence\": 0.8}], \"transitions\": [{\"target_node\": \"send_email\", \"description\": \"Caller clearly said yes to sending the statement to the registered address\", \"condition\": {\"logic\": \"or\", \"conditions\": [{\"variable\": \"email_choice\", \"operator\": \"equals\", \"operand\": \"yes\"}]}}, {\"target_node\": \"end_menu\", \"description\": \"Caller said no\", \"condition\": {\"logic\": \"or\", \"conditions\": [{\"variable\": \"email_choice\", \"operator\": \"equals\", \"operand\": \"no\"}]}}, {\"target_node\": \"end_mail_no\", \"description\": \"Address is wrong\", \"condition\": {\"logic\": \"or\", \"conditions\": [{\"variable\": \"email_choice\", \"operator\": \"equals\", \"operand\": \"wrong_address\"}]}}, {\"target_node\": \"email_limit\", \"description\": \"Caller asks another address, earlier statement, paper or SMS\", \"condition\": {\"logic\": \"or\", \"conditions\": [{\"variable\": \"email_choice\", \"operator\": \"equals\", \"operand\": \"other_request\"}]}}, {\"target_node\": \"end_fail\", \"description\": \"turn limit after valid-answer transitions\", \"condition\": {\"operator\": \"greater_than\", \"variable\": \"email_confirm.current_turns\", \"operand\": 2}}]}, \"email_limit\": {\"name\": \"email_limit\", \"node_type\": \"conversation\", \"on_enter\": {\"type\": \"llm\"}, \"task_message\": \"Current user turns since entering this node: {{email_limit.current_turns}}. On entry, before the caller answers this node (zero turns), use these instructions:\\nNo tool call. Say: Yalnızca