d question with at most two own-card examples.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R05\", \"nodes\": [\"select_card\", \"match_card\", \"prep_reselect\"], \"implementation\": \"All-cards refused with a try; partial names narrow or list names; unknown name/number gets the same list; switching returns to selection.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R06\", \"nodes\": [\"match_card\"], \"implementation\": \"Name, last4, last6, full-number stages with mandated sentences; digits matched only against visible digits; cardNumber kept unchanged; three tries.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R07\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\", \"match_card\", \"system_prompt\"], \"implementation\": \"Only last four spoken digit by digit (sel_l4w); first-digits request refused; no match on balance masked number.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R08\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\"], \"implementation\": \"Empty name gives 'Sonu X ile biten kartınıza ait'.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R09\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\", \"calc_email\", \"read_debt\"], \"implementation\": \"Intro glued to first debt currency in TL, Dolar, Euro, Sterlin order, one no-debt sentence, auto-pay, due date, other-card question, then offer.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R10\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\"], \"implementation\": \"TL cases tested in the mandated order with full currency names.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R11\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\"], \"implementation\": \"Foreign blocks read only when remainingDebt>0 with mandated form.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R12\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\"], \"implementation\": \"Joined no-debt sentence for existing blocks without debt; all-clear uses R13 reading.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R13\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\", \"read_debt\", \"end_rdg\"], \"implementation\": \"No-debt sentence with TL totalDebt only if >0; other-card question if multi, else main menu.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R14\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\"], \"implementation\": \"Empty statement and due date gives the new-card sentence with nextStatementDate only if returned.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R15\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\"], \"implementation\": \"Auto-payment sentence only if due passed, flag Y, remaining>0.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R16\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\"], \"implementation\": \"Due date with suffix, 'bugündür', or passed plus totalDebt, compared with now.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R17\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\"], \"implementation\": \"nextStatementDate equals today gives cut-day opening and totalDebt reading.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R18\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_reading\", \"calc_week2\", \"calc_decide\"], \"implementation\": \"Code converts amounts (lira/kuruş, sent, peni) and dates to Turkish words; nothing guessed.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R19\", \"nodes\": [\"fetch_email\", \"calc_email\", \"read_debt\", \"offer\"], \"implementation\": \"contact.email.get before the offer; ibanEmail decides the offer text; goodbye goes to main menu without repeating the offer.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R20\", \"nodes\": [\"read_debt\"], \"implementation\": \"One-figure facts, cut-in handled by reply extraction; e-mail request routes straight to the e-mail step.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R21\", \"nodes\": [\"email_start\", \"email_confirm\", \"send_email\", \"check_send\", \"end_mail_ok\"], \"implementation\": \"Only ibanEmail, shortened if long, send only after clear yes, success claimed only after 200/'1'/DONE.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R22\", \"nodes\": [\"email_confirm\", \"email_limit\", \"no_email\", \"email_start\", \"end_mail_no\"], \"implementation\": \"No/wrong address/other-request/no-email branches; sends capped at three; no automatic retry.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R23\", \"nodes\": [\"week_start\", \"fetch_week\", \"calc_week2\", \"week_current\", \"week_choose\", \"week_validate\", \"decide_week\", \"calc_decide\", \"week_confirm\", \"change_week\", \"check_change\", \"end_week_ok\"], \"implementation\": \"Full week flow: get, read, other weeks, preview, confirm, one change, result with preview dates.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R24\", \"nodes\": [\"calc_week1\", \"fetch_week_rel\", \"calc_week2\", \"calc_decide\"], \"implementation\": \"Related card fetched and read; joint sentence is separate and before the confirmation.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R25\", \"nodes\": [\"week_confirm\", \"email_confirm\", \"check_change\"], \"implementation\": \"Only clear yes counts; hedges and pressure re-ask; three tries; success check 200/'1'/OK/0; change happens once and the call then ends at main menu.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R26\", \"nodes\": [\"week_choose\", \"week_validate\"], \"implementation\": \"No invented eligibility flag; refusal by service goes to the week error sentence; limit text not quoted.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R27\", \"nodes\": [\"g_silence\", \"end_silent\"], \"implementation\": \"Separate silence counter; two shorter repeats; third silence ends the call with the mandated sentence.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R28\", \"nodes\": [\"select_card\", \"read_debt\", \"email_confirm\", \"week_confirm\", \"match_card\", \"end_fail\"], \"implementation\": \"max_node_turns=3 or try counters go to the failure sentence and main menu; repeat requests handled by loop prompts.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R29\", \"nodes\": [\"g_nonturkish\", \"end_xfer\"], \"implementation\": \"Only 'Sizi ana menüye aktarıyorum.' then hand over.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R30\", \"nodes\": [\"g_oos\"], \"implementation\": \"Asks first; yes goes to main menu; continue returns to previous node; three tries.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R31\", \"nodes\": [\"g_agent\", \"g_pay\", \"g_dispute\", \"g_angry\", \"end_agent\", \"end_agent_pay\", \"end_agent_dis\", \"end_agent_q\"], \"implementation\": \"Immediate agent sentences; three calming replies then transfer.\"}, {\"requirement_id\": \"R32\", \"nodes\": [\"end_agent_svc\", \"end_agent_wk\", \"prep_cards\", \"calc_reading\", \"calc_email\", \"check_send\", \"calc_week1\", \"calc_decide\",